  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Munna Ram vs State on 8 August, 2017 Author: Chief Justice Bench: Chief Justice High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan At Jodhpur S.B. Criminal Revision No. 85 / 1996 Munna Ram s/o Shri Govind Ram, by caste Jat, resident of village- Bambore, District - Jodhpur.",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "3. The proviso to Rule 12 of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Rules, 1955 reads as under: \"[Provided that in case where a food inspector draws a sample from an open container, he shall also draw a sample from the containing in original condition of the same article bearing the same declaration, if such container is available, and intimate this fact to the public Analyst.]\" 4. It is apparent that the Food Inspector who drew the sample from an open container was also required to draw sample from the container in original conditions of the same articles bearing the same declaration, for the reason the sample taking from the sealed container would have linked the purity thereof to the manufacturer. Munna Ram vs State on 8 August, 2017 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/195427821/ 1 5.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "",
    "respondent_arguments": "",
    "other_lawyer_arguments": "3. The proviso to Rule 12 of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Rules, 1955 reads as under: \"[Provided that in case where a food inspector draws a sample from an open container, he shall also draw a sample from the containing in original condition of the same article bearing the same declaration, if such container is available, and intimate this fact to the public Analyst.]\" 4. It is apparent that the Food Inspector who drew the sample from an open container was also required to draw sample from the container in original conditions of the same articles bearing the same declaration, for the reason the sample taking from the sealed container would have linked the purity thereof to the manufacturer. Munna Ram vs State on 8 August, 2017 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/195427821/ 1 5."
  },
